+## 6. Credential Safety Requirements
+
+All probes are governed by `tools/target-discovery/redact.py`:
+
+| Credential | Redaction rule |
+|------------|---------------|
+| `x-api-key` value | Replace with `[REDACTED-API-KEY]` in all capture files and logs |
+| `x-seller-id` value | Replace with `[REDACTED-SELLER-ID]` in all capture files and logs |
+| `x-seller-token` value | Replace with `[REDACTED-SELLER-TOKEN]` in all capture files and logs |
+| `tgtrt` value | Replace with `[REDACTED-TGTRT]` in all capture files and logs |
+| PII from `getOrderAddress` | Replace name, email, phone, address lines with `[REDACTED-PII]` |
+
+Redaction is applied **before** any capture file is written. The raw response object never touches disk.
+
+**Pre-commit hook:** Phase 7 test `test_credentials_redacted_in_logs.py` asserts that no capture file or log line contains the literal values of any of the four credential headers.
